{
    "title": "Wrist Chess",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf10 Play Online with Lichess \ud83c\udf10 \r\nConnect with millions of chess players from around the world with Lichess online play. Challenge your friends or find a random opponent with the same skill level.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Play Offline Against Stockfish \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\r\nChallenge yourself offline with games against the Stockfish engine. No internet? No problem. Hone your skills against a strong opponent even when you're on the go.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Dive into Chess Puzzles \ud83e\udde9\r\nSharpen your tactics with a diverse range of chess puzzles. Whether you're warming up for a game or just challenging yourself, these puzzles are sure to test and enhance your skills.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Watch Lichess TV and Channels \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f\r\nSpectate Lichess TV and channels to catch ongoing games and content. Get insights into various matches and styles of play, all without leaving your wrist.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Tune into Tournament Broadcasts \ud83c\udfc6\r\nStay updated with live broadcasts of chess tournaments. Follow the strategies, tactics, and tension of competitive play, all from the convenience of your watch.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc64 Follow Your Preferred Lichess Players \ud83d\udc64\r\nKeep tabs on your favorite Lichess players. Receive notifications about their latest moves and stay in the loop with their progress and games.\r\n\r\nDive into the chess universe with our Chess App for Android Wear OS. Download now for a comprehensive, on-the-go chess experience.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf10 Play Online with Lichess \ud83c\udf10 <br>Connect with millions of chess players from around the world with Lichess online play. Challenge your friends or find a random opponent with the same skill level.<br><br>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Play Offline Against Stockfish \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f<br>Challenge yourself offline with games against the Stockfish engine. No internet? No problem. Hone your skills against a strong opponent even when you&#39;re on the go.<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 Dive into Chess Puzzles \ud83e\udde9<br>Sharpen your tactics with a diverse range of chess puzzles. Whether you&#39;re warming up for a game or just challenging yourself, these puzzles are sure to test and enhance your skills.<br><br>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f Watch Lichess TV and Channels \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f<br>Spectate Lichess TV and channels to catch ongoing games and content. Get insights into various matches and styles of play, all without leaving your wrist.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 Tune into Tournament Broadcasts \ud83c\udfc6<br>Stay updated with live broadcasts of chess tournaments. Follow the strategies, tactics, and tension of competitive play, all from the convenience of your watch.<br><br>\ud83d\udc64 Follow Your Preferred Lichess Players \ud83d\udc64<br>Keep tabs on your favorite Lichess players. Receive notifications about their latest moves and stay in the loop with their progress and games.<br><br>Dive into the chess universe with our Chess App for Android Wear OS. Download now for a comprehensive, on-the-go chess experience.",
